Aerie-Purpose: Include the Widevine prompt strings (the text and the two buttons of the infobar that asks to turn on Widevine) in the browser's string resources, so the prompt is translatable.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/app/generated_resources.grd, chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #56. The messages are in chrome/browser/aerie_widevine/aerie_widevine_strings.grdp
(overlay). Same shape as adblock/0017 does for aerie_guard_strings.grdp. It sits between the
lines that patch adds, so the series lists it right after adblock/0017.

--- a/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd
@@ -295,6 +295,9 @@
       <!-- Aerie Guard strings -->
       <part file="../browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock/aerie_guard_strings.grdp" />
 
+      <!-- Aerie Widevine prompt strings -->
+      <part file="../browser/aerie_widevine/aerie_widevine_strings.grdp" />
+
       <!-- Media live preview specific strings -->
       <part file="media_live_preview_strings.grdp" />
 
--- a/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
+++ b/chrome/app/generated_resources.grd.gritdeps
@@ -110,4 +110,5 @@
 chrome/app/vr_strings.grdp
 chrome/app/whats_new_strings.grdp
+chrome/browser/aerie_widevine/aerie_widevine_strings.grdp
 chrome/browser/ui/views/aerie_adblock/aerie_guard_strings.grdp
 components/aerie_onboarding/aerie_onboarding_strings.grdp
